{"title":"2015 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a square with side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> are the midpoints of the sides of the square, as shown. What is the area of the shaded region?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/454312cf03566daeeba47ab97c9df6548633252b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12x = 4y + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/4/e94f7fba1a41035e34fd61eddabe644b62a638b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12x}{2} = \\frac{4y + 2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c154dcdf60a53c32cad4f30b0c5fef86dec39d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x = 2y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />. This also means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6ef1b25bcce9c8f4f37b8c65af48f64cd756de91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x \\times 3 = 3(2y + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/46791421907517a0de57e019d50ce98a714df975.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18x = 6y + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging this into the second equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/0/6d00f0af1751f064722036f295895f515bc9fc0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6y - (6y + 3) + 7 = -3 + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"217\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bc96d59cbe5aa8e65e3231999d0ef65197077c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC\" title=\"2015 CIMC\">2015 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5\">Part A Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018060730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 119/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1699/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 140/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2351/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.538      1 -total\n 47.36%    6.885      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n 43.22%    6.283      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37174:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018060730 and revision id 287074. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}